 "p": 0.17, "core": 1}, {"w": "situati,", "start": 580.157, "end": 580.857, "p": 0.014, "core": 1}, {"w": "बावद", "start": 581.177, "end": 581.997, "p": 0.671, "core": 0}, {"w": "बावद", "start": 581.997, "end": 582.097, "p": 0.837, "core": 0}, {"w": "मैं।", "start": 582.097, "end": 582.097, "p": 0.392, "core": 0}, {"w": "बावद", "start": 582.097, "end": 582.177, "p": 0.764, "core": 0}, {"w": "बावद", "start": 582.177, "end": 582.177, "p": 0.864, "core": 0}, {"w": "मैं।", "start": 582.177, "end": 582.177, "p": 0.852, "core": 0}], "segments": [{"start": 513.657, "end": 519.097, "text": "can select. Maths question can go to math expert, coding request to coding expert,"}, {"start": 519.417, "end": 524.417, "text": "translation to language expert. With this approach, all the module parts are not"}, {"start": 524.417, "end": 528.657, "text": "necessary to activate, resources can be saved, large system can be made efficient."}, {"start": 529.437, "end": 533.317, "text": "But router can select wrong experts, the workload of experts can be unequal,"}, {"start": 533.937, "end": 537.877, "text": "and by joining specialist modules, human intelligence cannot be created automatically."}, {"start": 538.877, "end": 541.157, "text": "ab abstraction aur transfer learning ko samajie."}, {"start": 541.537, "end": 543.117, "text": "Student cycle chalana seekta hai."}, {"start": 543.497, "end": 545.837, "text": "iske baad wo motorcycle ko bilkul zero se nahi dekta."}, {"start": 546.137, "end": 549.017, "text": "Balance, road aur steering ka kuch idea pehle se hota hai."}, {"start": 549.517, "end": 552.017, "text": "wo apni porani skill ko nahi situation mein transfer karta hai."}, {"start": 552.537, "end": 555.777, "text": "school me maths ka pattern seekne wala student physics ke kuch formulas ko bhi"}, {"start": 555.777, "end": 556.777, "text": "aasani se samaj sakta hai."}, {"start": 557.277, "end": 558.977, "text": "ai ke liye transfer learning ka matlab hai,"}, {"start": 559.277, "end": 562.257, "text": "ek task se seekhi hui representation ko dosre task mein use karna."}, {"start": 562.657, "end": 564.517, "text": "lekin transfer hameesha successful nahi."}, {"start": 564.877, "end": 567.477, "text": "game mein jo strategy kaam karte hain wo real business mein fail ho"}, {"start": 568.317, "end": 571.057, "text": "लबूरीट्री का देटा रील रोट की ट्राफिक को रप्रिजन्त नहीं कर सकता."}, {"start": 571.497, "end": 574.097, "text": "इसी लिए आबस्ट्ट्ख्चन के साथ ग्रूंटिंग जेरूँरी हो सकती है."}, {"start": 575.697, "end": 577.097, "text": "ृृृृृृृृ"}, {"start": 577.097, "end": 582.097, "text": "अभ भी बावद � situati, बावद बावद मैं।"}, {"start": 582.097, "end": 582.177, "text": "बावद बावद मैं।"}]}